Steam_store
| Column Name                 | Data Type | Description                                                      |
| --------------------------- | --------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **type**                    | string    | Type of record (often `"game"` or category marker in Steam API). |
| **name**                    | string    | Official game title.                                             |
| **steam_appid**             | float64   | Unique Steam application ID.                                     |
| **required_age**            | float64   | Minimum age required to play (e.g., 0, 18).                      |
| **is_free**                 | string    | Whether the game is free to play (`"true"` / `"false"`).         |
| **controller_support**      | string    | Controller support level (e.g., `"full"`, `"partial"`).          |
| **dlc**                     | string    | List of downloadable content appids.                             |
| **detailed_description**    | string    | Full HTML-rich description of the game.                          |
| **about_the_game**          | string    | Condensed overview of game features.                             |
| **short_description**       | string    | Short summary for store listings.                                |
| **fullgame**                | string    | Information about the full game package (for demos).             |
| **supported_languages**     | string    | Languages supported, may include formatting tags.                |
| **header_image**            | string    | URL of the game's header/banner image.                           |
| **website**                 | string    | Official website of the game or developer.                       |
| **pc_requirements**         | string    | Minimum/recommended PC system requirements (HTML).               |
| **mac_requirements**        | string    | macOS system requirements.                                       |
| **linux_requirements**      | string    | Linux / SteamOS system requirements.                             |
| **legal_notice**            | string    | Copyright or legal disclaimers.                                  |
| **drm_notice**              | string    | DRM–related information if applicable.                           |
| **ext_user_account_notice** | string    | Requirements for external user accounts (e.g., Ubisoft).         |
| **developers**              | string    | Developer names (may be multiple).                               |
| **publishers**              | string    | Publisher names (may be multiple).                               |
| **demos**                   | string    | Demo appids or objects.                                          |
| **price_overview**          | string    | Pricing object (currency, final price, discount).                |
| **packages**                | string    | List of package IDs associated with the product.                 |
| **package_groups**          | string    | Purchase group information (bundle definitions).                 |
| **platforms**               | string    | Platform availability (Windows/Mac/Linux booleans).              |
| **metacritic**              | string    | Metacritic score and URL.                                        |
| **reviews**                 | string    | User-written review snippets.                                    |
| **categories**              | string    | Steam-defined categories (e.g., Single-player).                  |
| **genres**                  | string    | Game genre list (e.g., Action, RPG).                             |
| **screenshots**             | string    | Screenshot URLs and metadata.                                    |
| **movies**                  | string    | Trailer and video metadata.                                      |
| **recommendations**         | string    | Total recommendations count.                                     |
| **achievements**            | string    | Achievement stats (total, highlighted).                          |
| **release_date**            | object    | Release date object (with `"coming_soon"` flag).                 |
| **support_info**            | string    | Support email/URL.                                               |
| **background**              | string    | Store page background image URL.                                 |
| **content_descriptors**     | string    | Age/violence content descriptor metadata.                        |


Steam_spy_all_data
| Column Name         | Data Type | Description                                          |
| ------------------- | --------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| **Unnamed: 0**      | int64     | Index column (often auto-generated when saving CSV). |
| **appid**           | int64     | Unique Steam application ID.                         |
| **name**            | string    | Game name.                                           |
| **developer**       | string    | Developer of the game.                               |
| **publisher**       | string    | Publisher of the game.                               |
| **score_rank**      | float64   | Rank derived from positive/negative reviews.         |
| **positive**        | int64     | Number of positive user reviews.                     |
| **negative**        | int64     | Number of negative user reviews.                     |
| **userscore**       | int64     | User score metric assigned by SteamDB.               |
| **owners**          | string    | Estimated ownership range (e.g., “20000–50000”).     |
| **average_forever** | int64     | Average playtime (minutes) since release.            |
| **average_2weeks**  | int64     | Average playtime (minutes) in last 2 weeks.          |
| **median_forever**  | int64     | Median playtime (minutes) since release.             |
| **median_2weeks**   | int64     | Median playtime (minutes) in last 2 weeks.           |
| **price**           | float64   | Current price in the lowest region (e.g., USD).      |
| **initialprice**    | float64   | Original full price before discounts.                |
| **discount**        | float64   | Discount rate (e.g., 0.2 = 20% off).                 |
| **ccu**             | int64     | Current concurrent users.                            |
